15px;line-height:24px;color:#191919;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:0 0 14px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Payment of £1,250.00 for Harbour at dusk is due today.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#191919;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:0 0 14px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">You can pay by card or bank transfer from your purchases. A bank transfer can take a day to reach us. If you have already paid, thank you.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border:1px solid #e6e8eb;border-radius:4px;margin:16px 0;overflow:hidden"><tbody><tr><td><table cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#757575;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:18px;padding:10px 12px 10px 0;vertical-align:top;width:36%">Work</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#191919;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;padding:10px 0;vertical-align:top">Harbour at dusk</td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#757575;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:18px;padding:10px 12px 10px 0;vertical-align:top;width:36%">Amount</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#191919;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;padding:10px 0;vertical-align:top">£1,250.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#757575;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:18px;padding:10px 12px 10px 0;vertical-align:top;width:36%">Due</td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #ededef;color:#191919;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;padding:10px 0;vertical-align:top">Thu 12 Nov, 23:59 GMT</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><a href="https://lax.bid/purchases/checkout/lot-1" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#000000;border:none;border-radius:4px;box-sizing:border-box;color:#f2f1df;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:16px 0;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Pay now</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#525252;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:16px 0 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">If you have questions, contact<!-- --> <a href="mailto:support@lax.bid" style="color:#091f5b;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">support@lax.bid</a>.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-top:32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#757575;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0">LAX Bid sends this email because it relates to your account, bidding, payment or auction activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#525252;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:0 0 8px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">LAX Bid is operated by London Auction Xchange LTD.<!-- --> Registered office: <!-- -->156 New Cavendish Street, Marylebone, London W1W 6YW, UK<!-- --> · 0800 208 4800 · support@lax.bid</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#757575;font-family:&quot;Outfit&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">© 2026 London Auction Xchange LTD. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Payment due today: Harbour at dusk",
  "text": "http://localhost:3000


Payment reminder


YOUR PAYMENT IS DUE TODAY

Hi Maya,

Payment of £1,250.00 for Harbour at dusk is due today.

You can pay by card or bank transfer from your purchases. A bank transfer can take a day to reach us. If you have already paid, thank you.

WorkHarbour at duskAmount£1,250.00DueThu 12 Nov, 23:59 GMT

Pay now https://lax.bid/purchases/checkout/lot-1

If you have questions, contact support@lax.bid.

LAX Bid sends this email because it relates to your account, bidding, payment or auction activity.

LAX Bid is operated by London Auction Xchange LTD. Registered office: 156 New Cavendish Street, Marylebone, London W1W 6YW, UK · 0800 208 4800 · support@lax.bid

© 2026 London Auction Xchange LTD. All rights reserved.",
}
